    "title": "Baker City man gets nearly 6 years in prison for 2024 crash that injured passengers - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Griffin Beach ,\n8 hours ago BAKER CITY — A 19-year-old man was sentenced to nearly six years in prison after a December 2024 vehicle crash that injured several people. Izek Cleveland entered guilty pleas to two counts of second-degree assault and two counts of third-degree assault-DUII. He was sentenced to concurrent terms totaling 70 months in prison followed by three years of post-prison supervision. Cleveland will not be eligible for any sentence reduction, work release, or early release programs. Read full article\n1",
